  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 81b9501dec89da64eb81f4c230bdd187, type: 3}
  m_Name: Skywing Tears
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HoneyAndHemlock.Customers.CustomerSO
  _requestedPotion: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d76ef143bcc876418cdc48fecfedccb, type: 2}
  _request:
  - "My daughter wants to see the sunrise from the top of Greymist Peak. She's turning
    18. I promised her I'd take her up there, but I haven\u2019t been right since
    I took an arrow to the knee. I can't make that climb."
  - I need to deliver a message to the lighthouse on Tinkerglow Cliffs before the
    storm rolls in. The path takes half a day on foot and the storm's coming in two
    hours. I need to cover the distance faster.
  _playerResponse:
  - Let's get you moving
  - You need swift travel
  _successfulResponse:
  - "We flew all the way to the top without stopping. The sunrise was\u2026 breathtaking.
    We watched it together. First time I've seen it from up there. Worth every coin
    I paid you."
  - I made it in less than an hour. It felt like I was flying the whole way. The
    message is delivered and the Tinkerglow Lighthouse is lit. The ships will see
    the warning in time.
  _failedResponse:
  - I made it halfway up before my legs gave out. And on the way down I started hiccupping
    uncontrollably. I've been hiccupping for an hour now. *hic* What was in that?
  - I got three steps down the path and now I'm stuck to the ground. Completely stuck.
    My boots won't lift. It's like the earth is holding me here. What did you give
    me?
  _cosmicResponse:
  - "I flew somewhere I shouldn\u2019t have. Something almost got me. I know I need
    to take my girl to Greymist Peak, but that was a little TOO high for me."
  - "I was weightless in the void and something patient was waiting for me. Too bad
    I couldn\u2019t just fly to the Tinkerglow Cliffs on the way back."
